cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite it as below, together with the
  accompanying paper.
title: >-
  Spanish-Enigma: A research toolkit for the cryptanalysis of Spanish
  Enigma K traffic (1936–1945)
abstract: >-
  Primary-source data and analysis tools for the cryptanalysis of the
  commercial Enigma K variant used on the Nationalist side of the Spanish
  Civil War: archival ciphertext transcriptions with provenance metadata,
  rotor wirings and procedural conventions, and an Enigma K simulator with
  statistical and hill-climbing attack tooling.
type: software
